{
  "id": 69427758,
  "iid": 84,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "TCP: do not use an unknown status when the checksum is 0xffff",
  "description": "Otherwise it triggers an assert when adding the column as the field is\ndefined as BASE_NONE and not BASE_DEC or BASE_HEX. Thus an unknown value\n(not in proto_checksum_vals[)array) cannot be represented.\nMark the checksum as bad even if we process the packet.\nCloses #16816",
